        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tony ne le planifie que les jours avec ce temps. Sans prévision, n’importe quel jour convient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tony reads when you’re busy, never what your events are about, and fits your tasks in the gaps. Nothing leaves your iPhone." : {
